[claims]

[probes]
?q1 What tool was used to measure that Kilo is less than 1K lines of code?
  = cloc
  > README.md:4 #292daf6ba680
?q2 What is the version string defined by the KILO_VERSION macro?
  = "0.0.1"
  > kilo.c:35 #90ed84b08fdd
?q3 Which errno value is explicitly ignored as non-fatal when editorOpen attempts to fopen a file?
  = ENOENT
  > kilo.c::editorOpen #a74a759a7b82
?q4 How many times must Ctrl-Q be pressed to quit when the file has unsaved changes?
  = 3
  > kilo.c:1187 #bddc20b86e60
?q5 Which key combination is used to find a string in a file?
  = CTRL-F
  > README.md:14 #a0280e8f56cc
?q6 What terminal color code is returned by editorSyntaxToColor for HL_KEYWORD1?
  = 33
  > kilo.c::editorSyntaxToColor #819747c749b1
?q7 What file permissions mode is passed to open() when editorSave creates or opens the file?
  = 0644
  > kilo.c::editorSave #a9e9709084c7
?q8 Which function handles the BACKSPACE, CTRL_H, and DEL_KEY keypress events?
  = editorDelChar()
  > kilo.c::editorProcessKeypress #1164e28a1a02
?q9 What escape sequences does Kilo use instead of relying on libraries like curses?
  = VT100 (and similar terminals) escape sequences
  > README.md:16-17 #efb6b4eb18e1
?q10 Which errno code is set if STDIN_FILENO is not a tty in enableRawMode?
  = ENOTTY
  > kilo.c::enableRawMode #cd72cf1e3c04
?q11 How many seconds must elapse before the status message is no longer displayed on the screen?
  = 5
  > kilo.c:977 #2ed6dc6f2d15
?q12 Why is E.screenrows decreased by 2 in updateWindowSize?
  = To get room for the status bar.
  > kilo.c::updateWindowSize #6516dd852835
?q13 From which two previous projects did the author borrow code to write Kilo?
  = load81 and linenoise
  > README.md:18-19 #21ed19e0bfb9
?q14 Which key code value is returned when the escape sequence ESC [ 3 ~ is read?
  = DEL_KEY
  > kilo.c::editorReadKey #1235ba3b05b0
?q15 What symbol character is displayed in editorRefreshScreen when a non-printable character has a code value of 26 or less?
  = '@'+c[j]
  > kilo.c:924-925 #c14df5fcfc38
?q16 Which signal is caught to handle window resize events?
  = SIGWINCH
  > kilo.c::initEditor #880014f10916
?q17 Who is the author of Kilo?
  = Salvatore Sanfilippo aka antirez
  > README.md:25-26 #1738738f099b
?q18 Under what condition will editorUpdateRow print an error message and exit?
  = When allocsize exceeds UINT32_MAX
  > kilo.c::editorUpdateRow #298eb05dee6b
?q19 What is the maximum allowed query length defined for find mode?
  = 256
  > kilo.c:1012 #f8ea1756a445
?q20 What help message is initially displayed in the status bar upon launching main?
  = "HELP: Ctrl-S = save | Ctrl-Q = quit | Ctrl-F = find"
  > kilo.c::main #846ece275c31
?q21 Under what license is Kilo released?
  = BSD 2 clause license
  > README.md:25-26 #1738738f099b
?q22 What function is registered as an exit handler within enableRawMode?
  = editorAtExit
  > kilo.c::enableRawMode #cd72cf1e3c04
?q23 When a search match is located in editorFind, what highlight value is applied across the matching substring?
  = HL_MATCH
  > kilo.c:1092 #1a6b887bd822
?q24 What error message is printed if the program is not executed with exactly 2 arguments?
  = "Usage: kilo <filename>\n"
